   $q$What is the author's claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Students with allergies should stay out of classrooms.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Guinea pigs are the only animals that belong in schools.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"},{"text":"Every classroom at Oak Ridge should have a small pet.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Teachers are too busy to take care of class pets.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Every classroom at Oak Ridge should have a small pet.$q$, $q$The author says, "every classroom in our school should have a small pet like Pepper." The idea that teachers are too busy is an opposing view the author answers.$q$, 'draft', 'cbff0084-36ee-5e27-b4a1-e00be08cc3ea')
