  ('31076410-20db-5657-8858-5679022612ad', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-argument-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which claim is NOT supported by reasons or evidence in the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Many families have old instruments sitting unused at home.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misjudges-support"},{"text":"A new clarinet or trumpet can cost hundreds of dollars.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misjudges-support"},{"text":"Band is the best class at Riverside, and everyone who joins loves it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Cost is a major reason some students do not join the band.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misjudges-support"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Band is the best class at Riverside, and everyone who joins loves it.$q$, $q$The author offers no survey of band members or comparison to other classes, so "the best class" and "everyone ... loves it" are unsupported. The idea about old instruments is backed by the eleven donations.$q$, 'draft', '83c2be5a-e039-5bbd-84a7-1cf96488553f')
